<p>Focus your predation on the most worthy prey. Upon entering a level for the first time, up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 2, 3, 3</acronym> foes are marked as your prey. You gain vision of them, wherever they are. Additionally, all damage you receive from their subtype is reduced by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5%, 8%, 10%, 13%, 15%.</acronym></p>